1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
中国烧烤，一年三千多亿
BBQ in China: 300+ billion a year

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
52万家店，烟火气拉满
520,000 shops, pure street smoke

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
夏夜的一半，是烤炉给的
Half of summer nights is the grill

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
41%的人，蹲在夜市路边吃
41% eat right on the street

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
淄博三件套：小炉、小饼、蘸料
Zibo trio: grill, flatbread, dip

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
撸下一串，卷进小饼
Slide a skewer, roll the bread

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
东北话怎么说？"整点串儿"
Up north they say "zheng dian chuan'r"

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
"整"是万能动词，来点的意思
"Zheng" is the do-anything verb

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
三五个人，撸串到深夜
Three or five friends, skewers till late

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
那52万家店，卖的是夜
Those 520k shops sell the night

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
你家夜市，最爱撸哪串？
Your night market's best skewer?

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
下集：来碗冰粉，透心凉
Next: a bowl of iced jelly
